  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Power of Nutrition Financing Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide match funding to a new nutrition funding facility called &#x2018;The Power of Nutrition&#x2019; which will stimulate new funding streams for scale up of high impact nutrition interventions to reduce undernutrition in DFID priority countries, to be delivered through national nutrition programmes, through support from the World Bank and UNICEF.  Each pound of money committed by new funders will unlock a pound of UK support, up to the maximum agreed funding level of the programme.</narrative>
  </description>
